            cand list 'List targets configured beneath MM_HOME'
            cand show 'Show one target from the shared catalog'
            cand nodes 'List every node of the selected environment''s target: whether it answers (and why not), its mmd version, its mesh address, and the commit and time of its last applied deployment'
            cand mesh 'The WireGuard mesh between the nodes of the selected environment''s target: look at it, or replace one node''s key'
            cand storage 'The shared volumes of the selected environment''s target: the node that keeps them, their sizes, and which nodes mount them; or delete one volume''s files'
            cand connections 'List the SSH connections this device keeps open to remote hosts between commands, or close them'
            cand trust 'Review a repo-declared target''s host key and daemon identity, and accept a change with --yes'
            cand add 'Add an SSH target to the shared catalog'
            cand update 'Update an SSH target without changing its stable identity'
            cand remove 'Remove a target only if its reviewed fingerprint still matches'
            cand select 'Select a private target preference for this project'
            cand preference 'Show or change private runtime and target preferences'
            cand setup 'Plan or apply target provisioning and project enrollment'
            cand ingress 'Configure and plan the target-owned ingress stack'
            cand access 'Administer remote developer access on a target'
        }
